{"slug":"typewriter","category":"text","nameJa":"タイプライター","params":[{"key":"speed","label":"speed(1文字の間隔 ms)","min":30,"max":200,"step":10,"default":70,"desc":"70前後が人の打鍵らしい速さ。120を超えると焦れったくなる。"},{"key":"blink","label":"blink(キャレット点滅周期 s)","min":0.3,"max":1.2,"step":0.05,"default":0.6,"desc":"1周期でON/OFFが1回ずつ。0.5〜0.7sが端末の標準的な点滅感。"}],"promptTemplate":"テキストに typewriter effect を実装してください。\n\n- 一文を {{speed}}ms 間隔で1文字ずつ表示する(sliceの長さを進める方式。時間管理はrequestAnimationFrame)\n- 文末に▌のキャレットを置き、{{blink}}s 周期で点滅させる\n- 打ち終わったら1.5秒静止し、テキストをクリアして最初からループ再生する\n- 全文と同じ幅を透明なダミーテキストで先に確保し、タイプ中にレイアウトが動かないようにする\n- prefers-reduced-motion 時は全文を即表示し、キャレットの点滅を止める","related":[{"slug":"text-scramble","nameJa":"テキストスクランブル","nameEn":"text scramble / text shuffle","category":"hover","poster":"https://ryota4100221-cmyk.github.io/motion-dict/v2/posters/text-scramble.jpg"},{"slug":"counter","nameJa":"カウントアップ","nameEn":"count up / number counter","category":"text","poster":"https://ryota4100221-cmyk.github.io/motion-dict/v2/posters/counter.jpg"},{"slug":"split-text-reveal","nameJa":"分割テキストリビール","nameEn":"split text reveal / stagger text","category":"text","poster":"https://ryota4100221-cmyk.github.io/motion-dict/v2/posters/split-text-reveal.jpg"}],"video":"https://ryota4100221-cmyk.github.io/motion-dict/v2/videos/typewriter.mp4","poster":"https://ryota4100221-cmyk.github.io/motion-dict/v2/posters/typewriter.jpg","posterAt":0.6,"prev":{"slug":"block-reveal","nameJa":"ブロックリビール","nameEn":"block reveal / bar wipe reveal","category":"text","poster":"https://ryota4100221-cmyk.github.io/motion-dict/v2/posters/block-reveal.jpg"},"next":{"slug":"counter","nameJa":"カウントアップ","nameEn":"count up / number counter","category":"text","poster":"https://ryota4100221-cmyk.github.io/motion-dict/v2/posters/counter.jpg"}}